      "writtenOn": "2022-09-21T00:08:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The problem with HOOK_POWER_SUPPLY_CHANGE is it\u0027s notified *after* port swithing (which is done by board_set_active_charge_port). That means, throttle_ap (in update_power_source) won\u0027t be called when port switching is taking place (e.g. BJ -\u003e USB or USB -\u003e BJ). So, during this period, the system can be running at full speed yet the power source is only the battery. Is it ok?",
